---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: ""
---
<div class="home-intro">
  <p>I'm Clint Kennedy. I build things on the web, think about technology, and write about what I learn along the way.</p>
  <p>This site is my corner of the internet — a place for long-form writing, half-formed ideas, and the projects I'm working on. Everything here is available via <a href="/journal/feed.xml">RSS</a> and the open web.</p>
</div>

<section class="home-section">
  <h2>Latest from the Journal</h2>
  <ul class="post-list">
    {% for post in collections.journal | head(3) %}
    <li>
      <div class="post-title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></div>
      <div class="post-meta">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</div>
      <div class="post-excerpt">{{ post.content | excerpt }}</div>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <p><a href="/journal/">All journal entries →</a></p>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
  <h2>Recent Ideas</h2>
  <ul class="post-list">
    {% for post in collections.ideas | head(3) %}
    <li>
      <div class="post-title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></div>
      <div class="post-meta">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</div>
      <div class="post-excerpt">{{ post.content | excerpt }}</div>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <p><a href="/ideas/">All ideas →</a></p>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
  <h2>Projects</h2>
  <ul class="post-list">
    {% for post in collections.projects | head(5) %}
    <li>
      <div class="post-title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></div>
      <div class="post-meta">{{ post.data.status or "Active" }}</div>
      {% if post.data.netlify_url %}
        <a class="project-link" href="{{ post.data.netlify_url }}">View live on Netlify</a>
      {% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <p><a href="/projects/">All projects →</a></p>
</section>
